  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.0,
      "text": "This graph makes a lot of people nervous.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026611
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 4.0,
      "end": 5.0,
      "text": "Why?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026611
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 5.0,
      "end": 10.0,
      "text": "It appears to predict that America is about to go into a recession.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026611
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 14.0,
      "text": "It's based on an economic indicator called the yield curve.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026611
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 18.0,
      "text": "So if you care about the economy, you should probably care about what's going on with the yield curve.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026611
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 21.0,
      "text": "That's Alice Fullwood, the economist's Wall Street correspondent.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026611
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 21.0,
      "end": 27.0,
      "text": "And the reason people get sort of so head up about this is that each time the yield curve has inverted,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026611
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 27.0,
      "end": 31.0,
      "text": "it has immediately preceded a recession in America.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.059681,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000245
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 37.0,
      "text": "In fact, only on one occasion in the last 70 years has there been a false alarm.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.059681,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000245
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 37.0,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "And here's the thing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.059681,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000245
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 42.0,
      "text": "It inverted in March of this year.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.059681,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000245
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 42.0,
      "end": 48.0,
      "text": "So what is it about this curve that seems to make it such a good indicator of where the economy is heading?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.059681,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000245
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 48.0,
      "end": 54.0,
      "text": "The line illustrates the return, or yield, investors get from investing in government bonds,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.059681,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000245
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 54.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "from short-term investments on the left to longer-term ones on the right.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0017
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 62.0,
      "text": "Usually, the longer the time frame, the higher the interest rate,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0017
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 62.0,
      "end": 66.0,
      "text": "as investors demand a bigger return if they're to lock their money up for longer.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0017
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 66.0,
      "end": 70.0,
      "text": "However, if investors fear the economy is slowing down,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0017
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 70.0,
      "end": 75.0,
      "text": "then the long-term rates can drop below short-term rates, the curve inverts.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0017
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 79.0,
      "text": "So when the yield curve inverts, something strange is going on.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0017
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 79.0,
      "end": 80.0,
      "text": "Here's why.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0017
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 84.0,
      "text": "When the outlook is gloomy, investors are more likely to buy safe assets,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051281,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002432
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 84.0,
      "end": 90.0,
      "text": "like long-term bonds, pushing their price up so the interest rate for holding them falls.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051281,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002432
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 90.0,
      "end": 95.0,
      "text": "Higher bond prices are also a signal that there are fewer exciting investment opportunities elsewhere,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051281,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002432
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 95.0,
      "end": 97.0,
      "text": "such as the stock market.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051281,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002432
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 97.0,
      "end": 100.0,
      "text": "Of course, there are plenty of other indicators you could look at",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051281,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002432
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 100.0,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "to get a sense of what's happening to the economy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051281,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002432
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 106.0,
      "text": "A lot of people look at the stock market, survey data,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051281,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002432
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 106.0,
      "end": 109.0,
      "text": "so you can go out and ask businesses what they feel.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051281,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002432
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 109.0,
      "end": 111.0,
      "text": "You can look at consumer behavior.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 111.0,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "You could also look at various metals prices,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 116.0,
      "text": "like if copper prices are very high, copper is an industrial metal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 116.0,
      "end": 120.0,
      "text": "It implies that lots of manufacturing companies are buying copper to make goods.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 120.0,
      "end": 123.0,
      "text": "Then there's the rate of change in unemployment,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 123.0,
      "end": 126.0,
      "text": "which correlates closely with recessions.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 126.0,
      "end": 130.0,
      "text": "And even monitoring the number of times that newspapers publish the word",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 130.0,
      "end": 133.0,
      "text": "recession can help to anticipate a downturn.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 133.0,
      "end": 136.0,
      "text": "But bear in mind that when you're trying to predict a downturn,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074815,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000588
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 136.0,
      "end": 141.0,
      "text": "you're often trying to get a read on people's expectations of where the economy is heading,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07058,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00048
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 141.0,
      "end": 144.0,
      "text": "which is why that curve is so useful.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07058,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00048
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 144.0,
      "end": 149.0,
      "text": "Everyone invests in the U.S. Treasury market from the Chinese central bank",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07058,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00048
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 149.0,
      "end": 153.0,
      "text": "to pension funds in Canada and Europe, hedge funds in America.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07058,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00048
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 153.0,
      "end": 157.0,
      "text": "Everyone is exposed to and invests in the U.S. Treasury market.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07058,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00048
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 157.0,
      "end": 161.0,
      "text": "So if you're looking for an aggregate opinion of everyone in the world,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07058,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00048
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 161.0,
      "end": 163.0,
      "text": "what they think might happen to the U.S. economy,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07058,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00048
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 163.0,
      "end": 165.0,
      "text": "and by extension the global economy,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 165.0,
      "end": 168.0,
      "text": "you'd be very hard for us to find something more important to look at",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 168.0,
      "end": 170.0,
      "text": "than the Treasury market and the yield curve.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 170.0,
      "end": 174.0,
      "text": "But these are extraordinary times for the U.S. economy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 174.0,
      "end": 177.0,
      "text": "It's always a dangerous thing to say, but it really could be different this time.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 177.0,
      "end": 181.0,
      "text": "The U.S. economy has undergone a lot of very experimental",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 181.0,
      "end": 184.0,
      "text": "and sort of extraordinary monetary policy over the last 10 years,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 184.0,
      "end": 187.0,
      "text": "in particular people highlight quantitative easing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 187.0,
      "end": 191.0,
      "text": "Quantitative easing was a policy to stimulate the economy",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060962,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 191.0,
      "end": 193.0,
      "text": "after the 2008 financial crisis,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081736,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00115
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 193.0,
      "end": 198.0,
      "text": "whereby the Federal Reserve bought treasuries to reduce long-term interest rates.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081736,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00115
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 198.0,
      "end": 202.0,
      "text": "Some experts believe it's distorted the yield curve.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081736,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00115
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 202.0,
      "end": 205.0,
      "text": "And some people argue that that means that long-term interest rates",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081736,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00115
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 205.0,
      "end": 207.0,
      "text": "can't quite signal what they used to in the past.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081736,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00115
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 207.0,
      "end": 211.0,
      "text": "They're no longer this sort of clean look at what investors are thinking",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081736,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00115
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 211.0,
      "end": 214.0,
      "text": "about growth and inflation, because quantitative easing",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081736,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00115
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 214.0,
      "end": 217.0,
      "text": "and that process has sort of systematically,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081736,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00115
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 217.0,
      "end": 221.0,
      "text": "or it's sort of fundamentally changed what long-term interest rates show you.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 221.0,
      "end": 224.0,
      "text": "So should investors worry about the inverted yield curve?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 224.0,
      "end": 227.0,
      "text": "While you can debate whether the yield curve",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 227.0,
      "end": 230.0,
      "text": "inverting in the U.S. in March of this year necessarily means",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 230.0,
      "end": 232.0,
      "text": "that there'll be a recession in the U.S. soon,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 232.0,
      "end": 235.0,
      "text": "what you probably can say is that it's not a great signal",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 235.0,
      "end": 237.0,
      "text": "that growth next year will be strong.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 237.0,
      "end": 239.0,
      "text": "The flattening that's taken place over the last year",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 239.0,
      "end": 242.0,
      "text": "suggests that growth should slow from 3% next year to 2%.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 242.0,
      "end": 246.0,
      "text": "In other words, predicting America's next recession just got a little harder.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051541,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000153
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 247.0,
      "end": 250.0,
      "text": "But the indicators are starting to flash red.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.043538,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.166626
    }
  ],
